"匹配条目：使用 Last.fm 编目中这首歌曲的歌手写法，例如「Wang Leehom」发送为「王力宏」；编目中未找到时按原样发送。\n仅第一位：合唱歌手只保留第一位，例如「陶喆, 卢广仲」发送为「陶喆」，不查询编目；Last.fm 已收录该合唱条目时不截取。\n原始：按播放器报告的歌手原样发送。" = "Match: use the spelling Last.fm's catalog has for this song, e.g. Wang Leehom → 王力宏; sent as-is when the catalog has no entry.\nFirst Only: keep just the first credited artist — 陶喆, 卢广仲 becomes 陶喆. No catalog lookup, and nothing is trimmed when Last.fm really does list the collaboration.\nRaw: exactly the artist the player reports.";
