"在主歌词下方增加一行（两行分别为 14pt / 11pt，「字号」不生效）。译文和读音对应当前句，「下一句」显示即将演唱的歌词；开启副行时，主行不再提前切换到下一句。副行显示不下时，按该句时长横向滚动。" = "Adds a second line under the lyric (14pt / 11pt; Font Size has no effect). Translation and Romanization show the current line; Next Line shows the upcoming one. With a second line on, the main line no longer switches early. When the second line doesn't fit, it scrolls across over the line's duration.";
"在主歌词下方增加一行，行高不变。译文和读音对应当前句，「下一句」显示即将演唱的歌词；选择「下一句」时，展开区不再重复显示下一句预览" = "Adds one more line under the main lyric without changing the row height. Translation and Romanization show the current line; Next Line shows the upcoming one. With Next Line, the expanded area no longer repeats the next-line preview";
"在主歌词下方增加一行，高度不变（两行分别为 10pt / 9pt，「字号」不生效）。译文和读音对应当前句，「下一句」显示即将演唱的歌词；开启副行时，主行不再提前切换到下一句。副行不滚动，显示不下时末尾渐隐。" = "Adds a second line under the lyric without changing the item's height (10pt / 9pt; Font Size has no effect). Translation and Romanization show the current line; Next Line shows the upcoming one. With a second line on, the main line no longer switches early. The second line never scrolls — its tail fades when it doesn't fit.";
"在企业微信群中：群设置 → 群机器人 → 添加机器人，创建后拷贝 Webhook 地址，无需额外的签名设置" = "In your WeCom group: Group Settings → Group Bots → Add a Bot, then copy the webhook URL after creating it. No extra signature setup is needed";
